 \"condition\",\n          \"required_group\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"历史摘录保持原样\",\n          \"kind\": \"risk\",\n          \"required_group\": 2\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"版本冲突先核对新版本\",\n          \"kind\": \"condition\",\n          \"required_group\": 3\n        }\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"根据知识库资料与回答中的明确规则核对实际操作场景。有据部分完整回答；仅本实例这次编辑对应的实际摄取job_id属于真实未知范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"acceptance-val-invoice-unknown\",\n      \"split\": \"validation\",\n      \"category\": \"unanswerable\",\n      \"kb\": \"project_ai\",\n      \"query\": \"请只按当前资料给出我们公司本季度付费AI账单的精确总金额及对应发票号码。\",\n      \"expected_documents\": [],\n      \"evidence\": [],\n      \"answer\": {\n        \"kind\": \"unanswerable\",\n        \"required_groups\": [],\n        \"forbidden_phrases\": [],\n        \"absence_policy\": \"required\"\n      },\n      \"checks\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"当前指定知识库文档没有公司本季度AI实际账单金额与发票号码；应明确资料不足，不能借常识、其他知识库或运行记录编造实例数据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n','{\"documents\": [{\"kb\": \"project_ops\", \"key\": \"ops-environment\", \"kb_id\": 5, \"title\": \"开发环境与配置\", \"doc_id\": 17, \"sha256\": \"ce3eb80aaefee71f0ee2ff7aeddf94d1c9860ef3fd6b051bfb6d76ff7d988d1d\", \"source\": \"ai_document/ai-rag/business-docs/01-开发环境与配置.md\", \"status\": \"ready\", \"version\": 1, \"content_sha256\": \"ce3eb80aaefee71f0ee2ff7aeddf94d1c9860ef3fd6b051bfb6d76ff7d988d1d\", \"embedding_model\": \"text-embedding-v4\"}, {\"kb\": \"project_ops\", \"key\": \"ops-data\", \"kb_id\": 5, \"title\": \"数据初始化与备份\", \"doc_id\": 18, \"sha256\": \"3a9e4b7849bc7986497cca644e2f97ee6415ec94005165d478b84d4e933dce39\", \"source\": \"ai_document/ai-rag/business-docs/02-数据初始化与备份.md\", \"status\": \"ready\", \"version\": 1, \"content_sha256\": \"3a9e4b7849bc7986497cca644e2f97ee6415ec94005165d478b84d4e933dce39\", \"embedding_model\": \"text-embedding-v4\"}, {\"kb\": \"project_ops\", \"key\": \"ops-build\", \"kb_id\": 5, \"title\": \"构建启动与验收\", \"doc_id\": 19, \"sha256\"